### Terraform ###
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored - that one's meant to be committed (it
# pins exact provider versions, same idea as a package-lock.json).
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/crash.log
# Real credentials (see terraform/credentials.tfvars.example) and anything else matching
# *.auto.tfvars - never committed, only the .example template is.
terraform/*.auto.tfvars
terraform/terraform.tfvars
# SSH key + fetched kubeconfig for the AWS path (see terraform/aws.tf) - regenerated by
# `terraform apply` each time, never meant to be tracked.
terraform/generated/
# Saved plan output (`terraform plan -out=tfplan`) - a local, point-in-time binary artifact,
# not something meant to be versioned.
terraform/tfplan
